y.", "timestamp_created": 1709248481, "timestamp_updated": 1709248481, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 18, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 21, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "159570703", "author": {"steamid": "76561198028458693", "personaname": "Khell", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198028458693/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1595, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1499, "last_played": 1732840270, "avatar": "b11c0453b084e0a2ae53f2ed901d85a0fa1b6ad8"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great teamwork game.", "timestamp_created": 1709247871, "timestamp_updated": 1709247871, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 18, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 23, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "159568748", "author": {"steamid": "76561198069469999", "personaname": "Truly Meaningless", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198069469999/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 34202, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5254, "last_played": 1778339989, "avatar": "a52c556787be588f1c1aeb41ee1e5e798bfa7d13"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is incredibly fun. From mining ores, to killing bugs, to accidentally smashing your friends chrome dome in with a resupply pod, this game is one of the most fun games I've played. Except for accidentally taming a